stateDiagram
    [*] --> SystemOff

    SystemOff --> SystemOn: Joystick pressed or Serial on
    SystemOff --> SystemOn: Terminal command speed > 0
    SystemOff --> SystemOn: Potentiometer moved > 5%

    SystemOn --> SystemOff: Joystick pressed or Serial off
    SystemOn --> SystemOff: Terminal command speed = 0
    SystemOn --> SystemOn: Terminal command speed 1-100
    SystemOn --> SystemOn: Potentiometer changed

    SystemOn --> ServoRunning: Signal conditioned 150ms
    ServoRunning --> SystemOn: Signal fails validation

    ServoRunning --> SystemOff: Servo disabled
    ServoRunning --> ServoRunning: Speed changed

    note right of SystemOff: System OFF Relay OFF Servo OFF
    note right of SystemOn: System ON Relay ON Servo OFF
    note right of ServoRunning: System ON Relay ON Servo ON